infographic list-column-simple-vertical-arrow
data
  title Each header neutralizes one named attack
  desc The browser-side perimeter — the cheapest layer you own
  lists
    - label Content-Security-Policy
      desc script-src 'self' + nonce stops an injected XSS script from running
    - label Strict-Transport-Security
      desc max-age one year closes the SSL-strip downgrade and MITM window
    - label X-Content-Type-Options nosniff
      desc Stops MIME sniffing that executes an upload as HTML or JS
    - label frame-ancestors / X-Frame-Options
      desc Blocks clickjacking via an invisible iframe overlay
    - label Referrer-Policy
      desc Trims Referer so full URLs and path tokens don't leak
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
